  "name": "Lucky Number",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You dictate a particular number as your lucky number. When you make your daily preparations, choose a number from 1 to 6. Any time you roll a 1d6 and the outcome is that of your lucky number, including when you Draw a Card and get a suit that lines with this number, you can take the Sleight effect of this feat.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Sleight </strong>You reroll the 1d6 and take the number you prefer. The respective action gains the Fortune trait.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.dO8kHE5IdPa3Zoqe]{Cardplay: Sleight Used}</p>"
